uscular junction contain a specialized muscle membrane end plate F"},{"label":"C","text":"Stimulation of a nerve to the muscle result in a twitch F"},{"label":"D","text":"Depolarization blockade will occur on repeated stimulation of a nerve to the muscle F"},{"label":"E","text":"Threshold behaviors is not exhibited T"}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Pharmacology","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-03bb5a92acd6","stem":"The following compound (drugs) are correctly paired with the enzyme which they either inhibit or activate","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Pharmacology","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"Ketoconazole inhibits thromboxane synthase T"},{"label":"B","text":"Hydroxyperoxides activates cyclooxygenase T"},{"label":"C","text":"Tranylcypromine inhibits prostacyclin synthase T"},{"label":"D","text":"Zileuton inhibits lipoxygenase T"},{"label":"E","text":"Lipocortin inhibit cyclooxygenase T"}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Pharmacology","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-358bbe763763","stem":"Focally innervated skeletal muscle","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Pharmacology","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"Each muscle cell is innervated by a single branch of a motor neuron T"},{"label":"B","text":"Stimulation of the motor nerve will provoke an all or none response of the entire motor unit T"},{"label":"C","text":"Each muscle cell has several neuromuscular F"},{"label":"D","text":"Depolarizing blockade does not occur in these muscle F"},{"label":"E","text":"Calcium ions are not required during synaptic neurotransmission in these muscle F"}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Pharmacology","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-0bc43f5eacd8","stem":"The following prostaglandin endogenous are correctly paired with clinical indication","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Pharmacology","topic":"Unassigned topic","topicOriginal":"General","subtopic":"","suggestedTopic":null,"options":[{"label":"A","text":"Dinoprost is used in refractory postpartum bleeding due to uterine atony F"},{"label":"B","text":"Alprostadil by injection they keep the ductus open if required T"},{"label":"C","text":"Epoprostenol prevents platelets aggregation in haemodialysis T"},{"label":"D","text":"Misoprostol is administered into corpora carvenosa to initiate and maintain complete or partial erection lasting for 1- 3 hours F"},{"label":"E","text":"Alprostadil prevents drug induced irritation during NSAIDs, Corticosteroids or anticoagulant therapy F"}],"priority":0,"status":"practice_draft","flags":["topic_generic"],"keyVerified":false,"hasSourceAnswer":false,"needsFigure":false,"displaySubject":"Pharmacology","displayTopic":"Unassigned topic","answerAuditStatus":"not_adjudicated","sourceAnswerTrusted":false,"publicationStatus":"unverified_draft","auditFlags":["topic_generic"],"cleaningOperations":[]},{"id":"q-927e5688b428","stem":"Acute gout is treated with","type":"Single Best Answer MCQ","subject":"Pharmacology","topic"